{"seq":2,"slug":"variety-requisite-variety","title":"多样性与必要多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/viable-system-model/foundations/variety-requisite-variety","wordCount":1480,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"多样性与必要多样性\">多样性与必要多样性</h1><p>如果只允许 VSM 保留一条原理，比尔会毫不犹豫地选必要多样性定律。这条由 W. Ross Ashby 在 1956 年《控制论导论》中给出的定律，是 VSM 全部结构决策背后那把唯一的尺子：每当你问&quot;这个组织该不该再加一层管理&quot;&quot;这条汇报线够不够&quot;&quot;要不要把决策权下放&quot;，最终都化归为一个多样性是否匹配的问题。本篇是全 hub 唯一深讲多样性概念与这条定律的章节，后面所有篇章遇到它都只点到为止并链接回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-多样性是复杂度的度量单位\">核心概念：多样性是复杂度的度量单位</h2><p>在控制论里，&quot;多样性&quot;（variety）有精确含义：一个系统可能呈现的不同状态的总数。一个有三盏可独立开关的灯的面板，多样性是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3 = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>；一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个二元变量的系统，多样性是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。多样性就是控制论度量复杂度的单位，正如米是长度的单位。</p>\n<p>关键在于它增长得极快。当变量数线性增加，多样性指数爆炸。这解释了为什么任何试图&quot;由中心掌控全部细节&quot;的管理方式都注定崩溃——环境的多样性总是远超中心控制器能处理的多样性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>在 VSM 中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多样性 variety</td>\n<td>系统可能状态的数目</td>\n<td>复杂度的度量单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必要多样性</td>\n<td>控制器需具备的最低多样性</td>\n<td>一切设计的硬约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放大 amplification</td>\n<td>提升控制器多样性的手段</td>\n<td>如何让管理&quot;够用&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰减 attenuation</td>\n<td>削减被控对象多样性的手段</td>\n<td>如何让环境&quot;可控&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剩余多样性</td>\n<td>未被吸收、漏过控制的状态</td>\n<td>失控与意外的来源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"必要多样性定律的形式化\">必要多样性定律的形式化</h2><p>Ashby 的定律可以写成一个关于不确定性消减的不等式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为干扰源的多样性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为调节器（regulator）可用回应的多样性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 为结果（outcome）的多样性。Ashby 证明，调节器能把结果的多样性压低到的下限满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log O \\ge \\log D - \\log R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，要把结果的不确定性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>）压到零、实现完美调节，必须有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log R \\ge \\log D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是那句口号的数学版本：<strong>只有多样性才能吸收多样性</strong>（Only variety can absorb variety）。调节器的多样性若不及干扰源，必有一部分干扰无法被回应，剩余多样性就会以&quot;意外&quot;&quot;失控&quot;&quot;漏掉的客户投诉&quot;等形式冒出来。</p>\n<p>这条不等式的冷酷之处在于它没有例外。你不能靠更努力、更敬业去违反它；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，唯一的合法出路只有两条：放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 或衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放大与衰减-vsm-的两大调节杠杆\">放大与衰减：VSM 的两大调节杠杆</h2><p>既然完美调节要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 而环境的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 往往大得吓人，组织就必须在两端同时动手。<strong>衰减环境多样性</strong>：用分类、标准化、抽样、汇总把扑面而来的状态压缩成可管理的少数类别——客服把万千问题归为十几个工单类型，就是一次衰减。<strong>放大控制者多样性</strong>：用规则、培训、自动化、授权让控制端能产生更多样的回应——给一线员工授权当场决断，就是把决策多样性放大到了它本就该在的位置。两个杠杆的手段与作用方向可归纳如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杠杆</th>\n<th>作用方向</th>\n<th>具体手段</th>\n<th>组织例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>衰减 D</td>\n<td>压缩环境多样性</td>\n<td>分类、标准化、抽样</td>\n<td>把万千问题归为十几个工单类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放大 R</td>\n<td>提升控制端多样性</td>\n<td>规则、培训、授权</td>\n<td>授权一线员工当场决断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示一对干扰如何在环境与管理之间被衰减和放大共同&quot;夹&quot;到平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  E[环境&lt;br/&gt;极高多样性 D] --&gt;|衰减:分类/抽样/汇总| M[管理单元&lt;br/&gt;有限多样性 R]&#10;  M --&gt;|放大:规则/授权/自动化| A[对环境的回应]&#10;  A --&gt; E&#10;  R1[剩余多样性&lt;br/&gt;未被吸收的状态] -.漏出.-&gt; X[意外与失控]&#10;  E --&gt; R1\">flowchart TD\n  E[环境&lt;br/&gt;极高多样性 D] --&gt;|衰减:分类/抽样/汇总| M[管理单元&lt;br/&gt;有限多样性 R]\n  M --&gt;|放大:规则/授权/自动化| A[对环境的回应]\n  A --&gt; E\n  R1[剩余多样性&lt;br/&gt;未被吸收的状态] -.漏出.-&gt; X[意外与失控]\n  E --&gt; R1</pre><p>比尔的洞见是：衰减和放大不该全堆在中心。把它们尽量布置在靠近环境的运营单元上——本地的人能用本地的回应吸收本地的多样性，远比层层上报再下达高效。这就从必要多样性定律直接推出了 VSM 对自治的偏爱，其结构原理见 <a href=\"recursion-autonomy\">递归与自治</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多样性工程-把定律落到通道上\">多样性工程：把定律落到通道上</h2><p>Ashby 定律不仅约束单个调节器，还约束系统内部每一条信息通道。比尔提出，组织里任意两端之间的连接，其通道容量必须足以承载需要传递的多样性，否则信息会在通道处被截断——这等价于一次非自愿的衰减。如何按定律设计具体通道与转换器（transducer），由专篇展开，见 <a href=\"../dynamics/channels-transducers\">通道与转换器</a>。本篇只确立原则：每一条线都要接受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的检验。</p>\n<p>值得一提的是这条定律的跨 hub 通用性。它在控制论 hub 里作为一般原理被独立讨论，见 <a href=\"../../cybernetics/feedback-and-control/requisite-variety\">必要多样性</a>；本 hub 的独特贡献是把它从抽象定律变成组织设计的操作准则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多样性是控制论度量复杂度的单位——系统可能状态的数目，随变量数指数增长。</li>\n<li>必要多样性定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>（只有多样性才能吸收多样性）是 VSM 一切结构决策的硬约束，无法靠努力规避。</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，合法出路只有两条：放大控制者多样性、衰减环境多样性；二者应尽量布置在靠近环境处。</li>\n<li>这条定律也约束每一条内部通道，直接催生了 VSM 对自治的偏爱与对通道工程的讲究。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"management-cybernetics\">管理控制论与 Beer</a>、<a href=\"recursion-autonomy\">递归与自治</a>、<a href=\"../dynamics/channels-transducers\">通道与转换器</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../cybernetics/feedback-and-control/requisite-variety\">必要多样性</a>、<a href=\"../../cybernetics/information-and-communication/information-theory-basics\">信息论基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多样性与必要多样性","id":"多样性与必要多样性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：多样性是复杂度的度量单位","id":"核心概念-多样性是复杂度的度量单位"},{"level":2,"text":"必要多样性定律的形式化","id":"必要多样性定律的形式化"},{"level":2,"text":"放大与衰减：VSM 的两大调节杠杆","id":"放大与衰减-vsm-的两大调节杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"多样性工程：把定律落到通道上","id":"多样性工程-把定律落到通道上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"管理控制论与 Beer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/viable-system-model/foundations/management-cybernetics"},"next":{"title":"递归与自治","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/viable-system-model/foundations/recursion-autonomy"}}